@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Settings companion
+
+`config/settings.json` is strict JSON and is copied byte-for-byte. `workers` is the numeric value zero, and `paths` is an empty array. No inspected code reads these keys, so whether zero has a special meaning is unresolved. This is a companion explanation, not inline annotation.
